      "start_line": 40,
      "text": "  rule duplicateOK(P:Val, C:Int, vCons(V:Val, R:ValSeq))\n    => notBool (nextRepeated(P, C, V) >Int 2)\n       andBool duplicateOK(V, nextRepeated(P, C, V), R)"
