      "start_line": 53,
      "text": "  rule sortedWithAtMostTwo(VS:ValSeq)\n    => (VS ==K sortVS(VS))\n       andBool scanDuplicates(-1, 0, true, VS)\n    requires nonNegativeVals(VS)"
